title: Choosing Our Enemies
new-page: true
view-if: b_enemies_timer <= 0
on-arrival: b_enemies_timer = 6; week_actions += 1
is-card: true
card-image: img/soviet_leaders.jpg
tags: b_party

= Choosing Our Enemies

In our media and campaign materials, who should we focus our attention on?

- @bourgeois
- @counterrevolutionaries
- @bourgeois_intellectuals
- @profiteers
- @vermin
- @clergy
- @germans
- @imperialists
- @mensheviks
- @concilators
- @defencists
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@bourgeois
title: The burzhooi, the rich, and their hangers-on. 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.capital_flight += 0.5; Q.instability += 1; 
  Q.leftcom_strength += 1*(1-Q.b_dissent); Q.leninist_strength += 2*(1-Q.b_dissent);
  Q.k_relation -= 1; Q.rightist_relation -= 5;
  Q.elites_unrest += 5; Q.middle_unrest += 2.5; Q.kulaks_unrest += 2.5; Q.intelligentsia_unrest += 1;
  Q.bourgeois_specialist_unrest += 5; workers_unrest -= 5; Q.peasants_unrest -= 5; Q.underclass_unrest -= 5;
  Q.provincial_unrest -= 5; Q.provincial_strength += 5; 
!}

Attacking the old capitalists elites or their lackeys is certainly popular among our base. 


@counterrevolutionaries
title: Counterrevolutionaries, reactionaries, [? if white_movement_seen = 1 : White-Guardists, ?] and Black Hundreds.
on-arrival: {!
  Q.capital_flight += 0.125; Q.instability += 2; 
  Q.k_relation -= 1; Q.rightist_relation -= 2;
  Q.elites_unrest += 5; Q.intelligentsia_unrest += 1; Q.bourgeois_specialist_unrest += 2; Q.workers_unrest -= 4; Q.peasants_unrest -= 2; Q.underclass_unrest -= 2; Q.soldiers_unrest -= 5; 
  Q.redarmy_unrest -= 5; Q.provincial_unrest -= 2; Q.provincial_strength += 2; 
!}

Decrying the threat of counterrevolutionary forces is a powerful rallying cry. 


@bourgeois_intellectuals
title: The bourgeois intellectuals, elitists, and old society types. 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.k_relation -= 1; Q.rightist_relation -= 3;
  Q.leftcom_strength += 1*(1-Q.b_dissent);
  Q.intelligentsia_unrest += 5; Q.bourgeois_specialist_unrest += 10; Q.bourgeois_specialists_strength -= 5; Q.bourgeois_specialists *= 0.95;
  Q.capital_flight += 0.125; Q.red_specialist_unrest -= 5; Q.red_specialist_strength += 5; Q.workers_unrest -= 4; Q.peasants_unrest -= 2; Q.underclass_unrest -= 2;
!}

Attacking the intelligentsia destabilizes pre-existing institutions, though it satisfies many rising progressives and radicals. 


@vermin
title: The vermin, parasites, idlers, and hooligans. 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.food_production = (Q.food_production * (1 - ((60/50)*0.03)));
  Q.leftcom_strength += 1*(1-Q.b_dissent); Q.leninist_strength += 2*(1-Q.b_dissent);
  Q.instability += 3;
  Q.elites_unrest += 2.5; Q.middle_unrest += 2.5; Q.kulaks_unrest += 2.5; Q.intelligentsia_unrest += 2; Q.bourgeois_specialist_unrest += 5; Q.workers_unrest -= 5; Q.peasants_unrest -= 8;
  Q.underclass_unrest += 5;  Q.underclass_strength -= 5; Q.provincial_unrest -= 8; Q.provincial_strength += 8; Q.union_unrest += 3; 
!}

Such rhetoric intensifies conflict in the countryside, which our provincial forces and supporters take advantage of.  

@profiteers
title: The profiteers, [? if bagmen_active = 1 : bagmen, ?] kulaks, and petty-bourgeois looters. 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.food_production = (Q.food_production * (1 - ((60/50)*0.04))); Q.food_sold *= 0.9;
  Q.leftcom_strength += 1*(1-Q.b_dissent); Q.leninist_strength += 4*(1-Q.b_dissent);
  Q.instability += 3; Q.crime += 5; Q.middle_unrest += 5; Q.middle_strength -= 2; Q.kulaks_unrest += 8; Q.intelligentsia_unrest += 1;
  Q.workers_unrest -= 4; Q.peasants_unrest -= 5; Q.underclass_unrest -= 2; Q.kulaks_strength -= 2; Q.soldiers_unrest -= 3;
  if (Q.bagmen_active == 1) Q.soldiers_unrest += 7;
  Q.bagmen_unrest += 5; Q.bagmen_strength -= 5;
  Q.underclass_strength -= 2; Q.provincial_strength += 3; Q.union_unrest -= 3; Q.union_strength += 2.5; 
!}

Such rhetoric reinvigorates our base, though exacerbates tensions with small business owners, wealthier peasants, 

@clergy
title: The clergy, the obscurantists, and their superstitions. 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.leftcom_strength += 3*(1-Q.b_dissent); Q.leninist_strength += 5*(1-Q.b_dissent);
  Q.instability += 2; Q.clergy_unrest += 10; Q.clergy_strength -= (5*(1 - Q.b_dissent));
  Q.intelligentsia_unrest -= 5; Q.bourgeois_specialist_unrest += 3; Q.red_specialist_unrest -= 2; Q.workers_unrest -= 2; Q.peasants_unrest += 4;
!}

Attacking Russia's old religious institutions is popular among our base, though polarizing for most others. 

@germans
title: The German warmongers, and their saboteurs and spies. 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.leftcom_strength += 8*(1-Q.b_dissent); Q.leninist_strength += 1*(1-Q.b_dissent);
  Q.instability += 1; Q.war_weariness += 2;
  Q.workers_unrest -= 3; Q.peasants_unrest -= 3; Q.underclass_unrest -= 3;
  Q.germany_relation -= 10; Q.austria_relation -= 2; Q.ottoman_relation -= 2;
  Q.uk_relation += 5; Q.france_relation += 5; 
!}

Attacking the German invaders resonates well with most everyday people. 

@imperialists
title: The imperialist powers - Britain and France primarily.
on-arrival: {!
  Q.leftcom_strength += 4*(1-Q.b_dissent); Q.leninist_strength += 3*(1-Q.b_dissent); 
  Q.workers_unrest -= 3; Q.peasants_unrest -= 3; Q.underclass_unrest -= 3;
  Q.uk_relation -= 10; Q.france_relation -= 10;
  Q.war_weariness += 2; Q.soldiers_unrest -= 5; 
!}

Attacking the foreign imperialists appeals to our base, and all those exhausted of continued war. 


@mensheviks
title: Mensheviks, SRs, and all such bourgeois "socialists".  
on-arrival: {!
  Q.sdi_relation -= 2; Q.left_m_relation -= 5; Q.centre_m_relation -= 5; Q.right_m_relation -= 5; Q.sr_relation -= 5; Q.right_sr_relation -= 5; Q.ns_relation -= 5; Q.k_relation -= 2; Q.rightist_relation -= 2;
  Q.sdi_strength -= ((1+Q.b_workers_org)*(1-Q.b_dissent) - (Q.sdi_strength / 50));
  Q.left_m_strength -= ((2+Q.b_workers_org)*(1-Q.b_dissent) - (Q.left_m_strength / 50)); 
  Q.m_strength -= ((2+Q.b_workers_org)*(1-Q.b_dissent) - (Q.m_strength / 50));
  Q.right_m_strength -= ((2+Q.b_workers_org)*(1-Q.b_dissent) - (Q.right_m_strength / 50));
  Q.sr_strength -= ((2+Q.b_workers_org)*(1-Q.b_dissent) - (Q.sr_strength / 50));
  Q.right_sr_strength -= ((2+Q.b_workers_org)*(1-Q.b_dissent) - (Q.right_sr_strength / 50));
  Q.ns_strength -= ((2+Q.b_workers_org)*(1-Q.b_dissent) - (Q.ns_strength / 50)); 
  Q.moderate_dissent += 4; 
!}


Attacking the other socialist parties reduces their standing among the working class and the soldiers.


@concilators
title: Conciliators, compromisers, and collaborators. 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.moderate_dissent += 6; Q.moderate_strength -= 3;
  Q.leftcom_strength += 2*(1-Q.b_dissent); Q.leninist_strength += 6*(1-Q.b_dissent);
  Q.sdi_relation -= 5; Q.left_m_relation -= 5; Q.centre_m_relation -= 2; Q.right_m_relation -= 2; Q.lsr_relation -= 5; Q.sr_relation -= 2; Q.right_sr_relation -= 2; Q.ns_relation -= 5; Q.k_relation -= 2; Q.rightist_relation -= 2;
  Q.sdi_strength -= ((1+Q.b_workers_org)*(1-Q.b_dissent) - (Q.sdi_strength / 50));
  Q.left_m_strength -= ((2+Q.b_workers_org)*(1-Q.b_dissent) - (Q.left_m_strength / 50)); 
  Q.m_strength -= ((2+Q.b_workers_org)*(1-Q.b_dissent) - (Q.m_strength / 50));
  Q.right_m_strength -= ((1+Q.b_workers_org)*(1-Q.b_dissent) - (Q.right_m_strength / 50));
  Q.sr_strength -= ((2+Q.b_workers_org)*(1-Q.b_dissent) - (Q.sr_strength / 50));
  Q.right_sr_strength -= ((1+Q.b_workers_org)*(1-Q.b_dissent) - (Q.right_sr_strength / 50));
  Q.ns_strength -= ((1+Q.b_workers_org)*(1-Q.b_dissent) - (Q.ns_strength / 50)); 
!}

Attacking the prospects of compromise with other groups galvanizes our primary base, though hurting our standing with all moderate forces. 

@defencists
title: Defencists, patriots, and expansionists. 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.leftcom_strength += 4*(1-Q.b_dissent); Q.leninist_strength += 2*(1-Q.b_dissent); 
  Q.soldiers_unrest -= 6; Q.workers_unrest -= 3; Q.peasants_unrest -= 3; Q.underclass_unrest -= 3;
  Q.uk_relation -= 2; Q.france_relation -= 2; 
  Q.war_weariness += 4; 
  Q.sdi_relation += 5; Q.left_m_relation += 5; Q.centre_m_relation -= 2; Q.right_m_relation -= 5; Q.lsr_relation += 5; Q.sr_relation -= 2; Q.right_sr_relation -= 5; Q.ns_relation -= 5; Q.k_relation -= 5; Q.rightist_relation -= 5;
  Q.m_strength -= ((2+Q.b_workers_org)*(1-Q.b_dissent) - (Q.m_strength / 50));
  Q.right_m_strength -= ((2+Q.b_workers_org)*(1-Q.b_dissent) - (Q.right_m_strength / 50));
  Q.sr_strength -= ((2+Q.b_workers_org)*(1-Q.b_dissent) - (Q.sr_strength / 50));
  Q.right_sr_strength -= ((2+Q.b_workers_org)*(1-Q.b_dissent) - (Q.right_sr_strength / 50));
  Q.ns_strength -= ((2+Q.b_workers_org)*(1-Q.b_dissent) - (Q.ns_strength / 50)); 
!}

Attacking the proponents of imperialist war angers the right-wings of the various parties, though fellow internationalists welcome this. 
